      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Vertical lines are imports: api.py -> every use case; use cases -> store/ and the adjacent domain / infrastructure box.\nEvery application and infrastructure package imports core/schema.py (infrastructure -> domain is not drawn: arrows point downward only).\nApplication reaches infrastructure through registries keyed by name. Cross-cutting modules import no layer.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Vertical lines are imports: api.py -> every use case; use cases -> store/ and the adjacent domain / infrastructure box.\nEvery application and infrastructure package imports core/schema.py (infrastructure -> domain is not drawn: arrows point downward only).\nApplication reaches infrastructure through registries keyed by name. Cross-cutting modules import no layer.",
